age). When not set, `/admin` shows an amber \"Demo mode: unprotected\" banner.\r\n  6: - **Guardrails audit:** `src/guardrails.test.ts` (renders ReportStep/CoverSheet/CheckItem to static HTML + scans the source). One fix: the printed cover sheet now prints \"Source · verified on · Provisional rule\" per listed check. The checklist is in `tasks/LOG.md`.\r\n  7: - **Rejection decoder** `/decode`: textarea → `POST /api/decode` → `ai.ts classifyRejection()` (zod `RawClassification`: one `RejectionCode` + confidence) → pure `decodeResult()` in `src/core/decode.ts`. ≥ 0.7 and not UNKNOWN → matched, with the fixed steps from `rejectionCodes.ts`; otherwise needs verification + `ASK_AT_OFFICE`. Digits are redacted before the model sees them. Linked from home (\"Got a rejection? Decode it\"). Works without AI (needs verification).\r\n\nmemory-bank/activeContext.md:36:240\n  34: \r\n  35: ## Previous state (after T2)\r\n> 36: T2 (main flow) is done. One mobile flow on `/` (client component `src/app/_components/KaagazApp.tsx`): scheme cards (PM-KISAN first, \"flagship\") → documents (photo per slot via `/api/extract`, \"type it in\", or samples A/B/C with a purple \"Demo mode: fake sample documents\" label) → confirm fields (low confidence in amber) → big Yes/No questions → report from `/api/check`. The report shows the Eligibility banner, the Readiness banner (+ \"check at the bank\" list), Fix before you apply, Please verify, OK (collapsed), benefit (central / state top-up separately), supporting docs, a print-only cover sheet and the bilingual disclaimer. Assamese default, English toggle (`src/i18n.ts`).\r\n  37: 150 tests pass; typecheck, lint and build are clean. The live Cline API reads a fake Aadhaar image correctly (image input works).\r\n  38: \r\n\nmemory-bank/progress.md:11:119\n  9: - [x] T3: \"type it in\" fix (doc counts only once its main field is filled) + Rule Maintenance Agent: `@cline/sdk` Agent with 5 zod tools, `node:sqlite` store (`rule_versions`, WAL, transactions), pure rule tests / diff / policy / merge patch, admin API (NDJSON stream, list, publish, reject), `/admin` UI (demo notices, live log, diff, tests, Publish/Reject, history), `scripts/agent-smoke.mjs`. Both demo notices verified live. 225 tests.\r\n  10: \r\n> 11: - [x] T4 (trimmed): optional admin passcode (`ADMIN_PASSCODE` → `x-admin-passcode` on `/api/admin/*`; passcode box / \"Demo mode: unprotected\" banner), guardrails audit (`src/guardrails.test.ts`; cover sheet now prints source + verified on), rejection decoder `/decode` (`classifyRejection` in ai.ts → pure `decodeResult`, ≥ 0.7 or needs verification + what to ask), `npm run demo:reset`, optional `AgeRange.max`. 264 tests.\r\n  12: \r\n  13: ## To do\r\n\nsrc/app/admin/AdminApp.tsx:195:14\n  193:       {!passcodeRequired && (\r\n  194:         <p role=\"note\" className=\"rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-amber-950\">\r\n> 195:           ⚠️ Demo mode: unprotected. Anyone who can open this page can run the agent and publish rules. Set ADMIN_PASSCODE in .env.local to\r\n  196:           require a passcode.\r\n  197:         </p>\r\n\nsrc/i18n.ts:17:14\n  15:   next: \"Next\",\r\n  16:   startOver: \"Start over\",\r\n> 17:   demoMode: \"Demo mode: fake sample documents\",\r\n  18:   scheme: {\r\n  19:     title: \"Which scheme are you applying for?\",\r\n\nsrc/server/adminAuth.ts:3:71\n  1: // Optional admin passcode for every /api/admin/* route.\r\n  2: // ADMIN_PASSCODE set (in .env.local) → requests must send the header `x-admin-passcode` with that value.\r\n> 3: // Not set → the admin API is open (local demo); /admin then shows a \"Demo mode: unprotected\" banner.\r\n  4: // The passcode is never logged or echoed back.\r\n  5: import { createHash, timingSafeEqual } from \"node:crypto\";\r\n\ntasks/LOG.md:101:178\n  99: - **Minimum data:** nothing is read from the death certificate or BPL proof (the engine only checks that they are present), so `husbandName` is not collected. The cover sheet shows the masked Aadhaar and no account number.\n  100: - **Empty manual docs:** \"Type it in\" adds the document with empty fields. The engine then counts it as present, and its fields show as \"please verify\"/\"could not read\". I think this is right (\"I have it, I'll type it\"); flagging it in case you prefer the slot to count only once a field is filled.\n> 101: - A sample replaces any documents and answers already entered and jumps to \"Check what we read\" (all sample fields are ≥ 0.8 confidence, so nothing is highlighted). The purple \"Demo mode: fake sample documents (A)\" label stays on every step and on the printed sheet.\n  102: - Unanswered questions are allowed; the engine marks them needs_verification (a note under the questions says so).\n  103: \n\ntasks/LOG.md:178:311\n  176: **1. Admin passcode**\n  177: - `src/server/adminAuth.ts`: optional `ADMIN_PASSCODE`. When it's set, all 4 `/api/admin/*` routes need the header `x-admin-passcode` (constant-time compare). Otherwise they return 401 `{ error: \"passcode_required\" }`, which never echoes the passcode. Unset or blank means open.\n> 178: - `/admin`: when protected, the server sends no history and the page shows a passcode box. The passcode is kept in sessionStorage (`src/app/admin/passcode.ts`, `useSyncExternalStore`), sent on every admin fetch, and cleared on a 401. There is also a \"Lock\" button. When unprotected, the page shows an amber **\"Demo mode: unprotected\"** banner. `.env.example` now has `ADMIN_PASSCODE=`.\n  179: - Tests: `src/server/adminAuth.test.ts` (4: pure checks + the real route handlers with the env var set; the agent never runs without the passcode).\n  180: \n\ntasks/LOG.md:212:157\n  210: - `npm test`: 35 files, **264 passed, 0 failed** (225 before + 39 new). `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm run build`: pass (`/decode` static, `/api/decode` dynamic).\n  211: - Live check (`next start`, real Cline API): \"Payment failed: Aadhaar not seeded with bank account\" → `matched AADHAAR_NOT_SEEDED_BANK` 0.98 with Assamese steps; a nonsense message → `UNKNOWN` → needs_verification. The log lines hold only fn/model/promptVersion/inputHash/outcome/ms. Without a key: needs_verification + `ai_unavailable`.\n> 212: - Passcode live check: with `ADMIN_PASSCODE` set, no header or the wrong one → 401 (list and publish), the right one → 200. Without it, `/admin` shows the \"Demo mode: unprotected\" banner.\n  213: - `npm run demo:reset` on the real `data/kaagaz.db` removed the 2 leftover T3 proposals (orunodoi-3 2.1.0, nsap-old-age 1.0.0, both `proposed`); a backup is in `%TEMP%\\kaagaz-before-reset.db`. Home then listed pm-kisan, orunodoi-3, nsap-widow (all 2.0.0), with no Old Age Pension.\n  214: \n","success":true}],"durationMs":44}}
